  title "The Medallion's Paths of Ice"
  summary "Lector ☽'Ilsancuia discovers an abandoned aurora-glass Medallion in ☽'Iarlocias's sealed nest and begins restoring it, unaware it is a dangerous artifact that awakens something in the deep ice beneath the Nightshelf. After encountering the missing ☽'Iarlocias, who had hidden the Medallion to prevent catastrophe, ☽'Ilsancuia becomes obsessed with reading the Medallion's pathways and continues polishing it despite warnings. Over years of restoration, the Medallion's glow intensifies, the Communion fractures into factions, and ☽'Ilsancuia dies while communing with the artifact, which is then enshrined but continues to emit an otherworldly pull that threatens the stability of the entire civilization."
